{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08921","headline":"冬日归旧山 · 李白","name":"冬日归旧山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未洗染尘缨，归来芳草平。\n一条藤径绿，万点雪峰晴。\n地冷叶先尽，谷寒云不行。\n嫩篁侵舍密，古树倒江横。\n白犬离村吠，苍苔壁上生。\n穿厨孤雉过，临屋旧猨鸣。\n木落禽巢在，篱疎兽路成。\n拂牀苍鼠走，倒箧素鱼惊。\n洗砚修良策，敲松拟素贞。\n此时重一去，去合到三清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}